{"title": "Grave Magic", "pageid": 21241, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Grave_Magic", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Necrotic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp/300px-Generic_Necrotic.webp, /w/images/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp/300px-Generic_Necrotic.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Grave Magic</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Cult_of_the_Absolute\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cult of the Absolute\">Cult of the Absolute</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Necromancer\">Necromancers</a>. It gives them an extra 1d8 Necrotic damage to their spell attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Whenever you deal damage with a spell, deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duckie_Verish\" title=\"Duckie Verish\">Duckie Verish</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kressa_Bonedaughter\" title=\"Kressa Bonedaughter\">Kressa Bonedaughter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Radija\" title=\"Radija\">Radija</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sarabayle\" title=\"Sarabayle\">Sarabayle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Susdera\" title=\"Susdera\">Susdera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Willinx_Jindlebee\" title=\"Willinx Jindlebee\">Willinx Jindlebee</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to an incorrectly used <code>DamageBonus</code> function, the bonus damage can never critically hit even if the spell's attack roll does.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715052334\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 744/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4668/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2715/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 541/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643696/52428800 byte